## 𝗚𝗼𝗮𝗹
This workbook contains data on employee compensation equality scores from Daikibo factories. The objective is to classify the scores into "Fair," "Unfair," and "Highly Discriminative" categories based on score thresholds.

## 𝗖𝗹𝗮𝘀𝘀𝗶𝗳𝗶𝗰𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻 𝗟𝗼𝗴𝗶𝗰
- Fair: Scores between -10 and +10 (inclusive).
- Unfair: Scores between -20 and -11 or 11 and 20.
- Highly Discriminative: Scores less than -20 or greater than 20.

